# Local bindings

Gitignored. Copy this file to `local.md` and fill in your own values — `CLAUDE.md`,
`references/sources.md`, and the skills read `local.md` for identity and source constants
instead of hardcoding them, so this repo can stay public with none of it exposed.

## Identity

| | |
|---|---|
| Name | |
| Title | |
| Home base | city/region — the assistant still detects the actual zone per-run, this is just the default |
| Email | |

## Jira

| | |
|---|---|
| Site | `https://<your-instance>.atlassian.net` |
| Cloud id | |
| Account id | |

Active projects, by volume:

| Key | Name | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| | | primary day-to-day work |
| | | inbound bugs / triage |
| | | program-level epics |
| | | occasional |

Projects with no Jira presence, tracked only in `TODO.md` via a `#slug` tag:

| Slug | Project | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| | | |

## GitHub

| | |
|---|---|
| Login | |
| Org | |

Repos you work in: `<org>/<primary-repo>`, `<org>/<repo-2>`, `<org>/<repo-3>`. Plus any
personal repos outside the org.

## Slack

| | |
|---|---|
| Workspace | `<workspace>.slack.com` |
| User id | `U...........` |
| Self-DM channel id | `D...........` (your own DM — useful as a scratchpad, useless as a notification channel, see `CLAUDE.md`) |
